WEBVTT

00:29:28.540 --> 00:29:31.423
Within a week of me sitting down
to write this novel,

00:29:31.447 --> 00:29:34.885
I was restoring myself
to who I am as a human being,

00:29:34.909 --> 00:29:36.761
because writing is what I do.

00:29:36.785 --> 00:29:40.026
And within a few months,
I had my vitality back,

00:29:40.050 --> 00:29:42.119
and I even had my joy back.

00:29:42.143 --> 00:29:44.633
I started that book
from a place of darkest grief

00:29:44.657 --> 00:29:47.599
and ended it in a place
of tremendous happiness,

00:29:47.623 --> 00:29:51.481
and I was a different person
at the end of that project

00:29:51.505 --> 00:29:53.164
than I was at the beginning of it,

00:29:53.188 --> 00:29:55.017
and I thought, "I can't believe that!"

00:29:55.041 --> 00:29:59.889
And yet, this is what I'm telling people,
day and night, is, "Trust me. Go try it.

00:29:59.913 --> 00:30:03.208
Go make this thing and see
not what you make,